# escape_end -- out: the night air at the source of the Boyne, and dawn not far off
#
# PLACEHOLDERS. The scene opens this at the top of the last stair; its last card sets escape_done.

@file underworld/escape
@encounter 3

= node 0 — out
@continue
[PLACEHOLDER] The night air. The source of the Boyne behind you, and dawn not far off.
% [Gaeilge le teacht]

= node 1 — to be continued
@note escape_done
[PLACEHOLDER] (To be continued: to the mouth of the Boyne before sunrise, without touching the ground.)
% [Gaeilge le teacht]
